:"flourishing"},{"surface":"வரகின்","parts":[{"text":"வரகு","lemma":"வரகு","gloss":"millet"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of millet"},{"surface":"பிறங்குபீள்","parts":[{"text":"பிறங்கு","lemma":"பிறங்கு","gloss":"shining"},{"text":"பீள்","lemma":"பீள்","gloss":"ear of grain"}],"gloss":"shining ears of grain"},{"surface":"ஒளிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"ஒளி","lemma":"ஒளி","gloss":"hide"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"increment"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"which hides"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வன்புல","parts":[{"text":"வன்புல","lemma":"வன்புல","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வைப்பி","parts":[{"text":"வைப்பி","lemma":"வைப்பி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"னதுவேசென்று","parts":[{"text":"னதுவேசென்று","lemma":"னதுவேசென்று","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தின்பழம்","parts":[{"text":"தின்","lemma":"தின்","gloss":"eat"},{"text":"பழம்","lemma":"பழம்","gloss":"fruit"}],"gloss":"edible fruit"},{"surface":"பசீஇ","parts":[{"text":"பசீஇ","lemma":"பசீஇ","gloss":"having hungered"}],"gloss":"having hungered","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"…","parts":[{"text":"…","lemma":"…","gloss":"…"}],"gloss":"…"},{"surface":"ன்னோ","parts":[{"text":"ன்னோ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"oh"}],"gloss":"oh"},{"surface":"பாண","parts":[{"text":"பாண","lemma":"பாணன்","gloss":"oh bard"}],"gloss":"oh bard"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாள்வடு","parts":[{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"வாள்","gloss":"sword"},{"text":"வடு","lemma":"வடு","gloss":"scar"}],"gloss":"sword scar"},{"surface":"விளங்கிய","parts":[{"text":"விளங்கு","lemma":"விளங்கு","gloss":"shine"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"இய","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"prominent"},{"surface":"சென்னி","parts":[{"text":"சென்னி","lemma":"சென்னி","gloss":"head"}],"gloss":"head"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செருவெம்","parts":[{"text":"செரு","lemma":"செரு","gloss":"war"},{"text":"வெம்","lemma":"வெம்மை","gloss":"fierce"}],"gloss":"fierce in war"},{"surface":"குருசில்","parts":[{"text":"குருசில்","lemma":"குருசில்","gloss":"chief"}],"gloss":"chief"},{"surface":"ஓம்பும்","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்பு","lemma":"ஓம்பு","gloss":"protect"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"protecting"},{"surface":"ஊரே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the town indeed"}]}],"literal":"Spotted-backed quail's fighting-strong male / outer skin removed sweet-tasting white sesame / in the winnowing fan drying proper time having taken together / summer Kongu's flower bud like / curved beautiful eared bandicoot rat to chase / flourishing millet's shining ears of grain which hides / dry land settlement that indeed, having gone / edible fruit having hungered … oh bard! / sword scar prominent head's / war-desiring chief protects town indeed.","translation":"Oh bard! Go to that dry-land settlement where the male quail with spotted back, strong in fight, chases the bandicoot rat with curved beautiful ears—resembling the summer Kongu's flower bud—making it hide among the shining ears of flourishing millet, while white sesame, its outer skin removed, dries in the winnowing fan. That is the town protected by the chief who loves war, whose head is prominent with sword scars.","modern":"பாணனே! போரிடுவதில் வல்ல புள்ளிகளுடைய முதுகை உடைய ஆண் காடை, கோங்கு மரத்தின் கோடைக்கால அரும்பைப் போன்ற வளைந்த அழகிய காதுகளை உடைய பெருச்சாளியைத் துரத்த, அது செழித்து வளர்ந்த வரகின் விளங்கும் கதிர்களுக்குள் ஒளிந்து கொள்ளும். உமி நீக்கப்பட்ட இனிமையான வெள்ளை எள் முறத்தில் உலரும் பக்குவத்தில் இருக்கும். அத்தகைய வன்புலத்து ஊருக்குச் செல்வாயாக. அது வாள் வடுக்கள் விளங்கும் தலையையும், போரை விரும்பும் தன்மையையும் உடைய தலைவன் பாதுகாக்கும் ஊராகும்.","explanation":"The poet is addressing a bard, directing him to the village of a generous warrior chief. The poem belongs to the Vākai tiṇai and Vallāṇ Mullai tuṟai, which praises the strength and hospitality of a warrior in a dry tract. The imagery vividly describes the dry-land landscape where a fighting quail chases a bandicoot rat with ears like Kongu buds, causing it to hide in the thick millet crops. Meanwhile, white sesame is drying in winnowing fans, showing the self-sufficient abundance of the land. The chief of this village is marked by honorable battle scars on his head, showing his bravery, and he protects this fertile settlement where bards can find refuge.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.77],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[1.9,2.81],[2.81,3.15],[3.15,3.48],[3.48,3.82],[3.82,4.0],[4.0,4.94],[4.94,5.22],[5.22,5.5],[5.5,5.78],[5.78,6.07],[6.07,6.44],[6.44,6.91],[6.91,7.37],[7.37,9.29],[9.29,9.44],[9.5,10.3],[10.3,10.6],[10.6,11.14],[11.14,11.69],[11.69,12.5],[12.5,12.9],[12.9,13.35],[13.62,13.95],[13.95,14.8],[15.05,16.14],[16.14,16.51],[16.74,16.86],[16.86,17.09],[18.0,18.6],[18.6,19.1],[19.1,19.5],[19.5,20.1],[20.1,20.3],[20.3,20.6],[20.6,21.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.98],[1.15,1.4],[1.4,1.9],[1.9,2.5],[2.5,3.3],[3.3,3.85],[3.85,4.4],[4.4,4.96],[4.96,5.51],[5.51,6.2],[6.2,6.5],[6.5,7.1],[7.1,7.6],[7.6,8.11],[8.11,8.78],[8.78,9.62],[9.62,10.04],[10.04,10.88],[10.88,11.3],[11.3,11.63],[11.63,12.3],[12.3,13.28],[13.28,13.58],[13.64,14.27],[14.27,14.8],[14.8,15.53],[15.53,16.05],[16.05,16.9],[17.12,18.1],[18.1,18.37],[18.56,18.73],[18.9,19.1],[20.0,20.8],[20.8,21.3],[21.3,21.63],[21.7,22.1],[22.1,22.5],[22.5,22.9],[22.9,23.4]]},"sync":[[["பொறிப்புறம்","spotted back"]],[["பூழின்","of the quail"]],[["போர்","fight"],["வல்","strong"]],[["சேவல்","male bird"]],[["மேந்தோல்","outer skin"]],[["களைந்த","removed"]],[["தீங்கொள்","sweet-tasting"]],[["வெள்ளெள்","white sesame"]],[["சுளகிடை","in the winnowing fan"]],[["உணங்கல்","drying"]],[["செவ்வி","proper time"]],[["கொண்டு","having taken"]],[["உடன்","together"]],[["வேனிற்","of summer"]],[["கோங்கின்","of the Kongu tree"]],[["பூம்பொகுட்டு","flower bud"]],[["பூம்பொகுட்டு","flower bud"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["குடந்தை","curved"],["அம்","beautiful"]],[["செவிய","having ears"]],[["கோட்டெலி","bandicoot rat"]],[["ஆட்ட","to chase"]],[["கலிஆர்","flourishing"]],[["வரகின்","of millet"]],[["பிறங்குபீள்","shining ears of grain"]],[["ஒளிக்கும்","which hides"]],[["வன்புல",""]],[["வைப்பி",""]],[["னதுவேசென்று",""]],[["தின்பழம்","edible fruit"]],[["பசீஇ","having hungered"]],[["ன்னோ","oh"]],[["பாண","oh bard"]],[["வாள்வடு","sword scar"]],[["விளங்கிய","prominent"]],[["சென்னி","head"]],[["செருவெம்","fierce in war"]],[["குருசில்","chief"]],[["ஓம்பும்","protecting"]],[["ஊரே","the town indeed"]]]}